Compile a Sounio source file

Usage: souc compile [OPTIONS] <FILE>

Arguments:
  <FILE>
          Input file

Options:
  -o, --output <FILE>
          Output file

      --native-stub
          Emit a minimal native executable stub (bootstrap helper)

      --emit <EMIT>
          Emit intermediate representation

          Possible values:
          - ast:  Abstract Syntax Tree (JSON)
          - hir:  High-level IR
          - hlir: Low-level IR (SSA)
          - llvm: LLVM IR

  -O <OPT_LEVEL>
          Optimization level (0-3)
          
          [default: 0]

      --glm-enabled
          Enable GLM-4.7 ML-guided optimization (requires --features glm)

  -v, --verbose
          Enable verbose output

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
